abstract: >-
  FightSafe AI v2.0.0 research software for an availability-aware interpretable
  temporal event pipeline. The GitHub repository is the official package: Tier A
  verification and regeneration of reported tables and figures from frozen
  canonical result files (run_20260730_005150), configs, aggregation schemes with
  explicit availability masking, environment metadata and checksums. The DOI
  above is the Zenodo version-specific identifier for v2.0.0. Concept/all-versions
  DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.20622868. Not a safety-certified system; not a
  state-of-the-art detector claim; not a medical device. Synthetic missingness
  only.
